{"id":"f1490c9f323a355a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-inaccessible-characterization.md","title":"Inaccessible Cardinal Characterization","display":"thm-inaccessible-characterization — Inaccessible Cardinal Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-inaccessible-characterization","aliases":["58-thm-inaccessible-characterization"],"display":"thm-inaccessible-characterization — Inaccessible Cardinal Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-inaccessible-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-inaccessible-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inaccessible-characterization — Inaccessible Cardinal Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>（候选基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\\)</span>（强不可达谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\)</span>（强极限谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Inaccessible” here means strongly inaccessible; weak inaccessibility replaces strong limit by limit cardinal.</li>\n<li>ZFC proves the existence of arbitrarily large finite cardinals, but inaccessible cardinals require additional axioms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":